---
// Safe to edit by hand
// The optional site motif under the name on the /studio loading splash
// (src/pages/studio/index.astro, PORTS.md card 120). NOT PORTABLE: a site draws
// its own art here (plain SVG or HTML, decorative, no script).
//
// First Baptist Church Muncie: the row of lancet windows in gold line, the same
// file the Studio Home banner draws along its foot (public/studio-banner/,
// card 118). Gold reads on the paper and on the dark ground alike. The ends
// fade so the row does not stop at a hard edge.
---

<img
  src="/studio-banner/lancets-phone.svg"
  alt=""
  width="312"
  height="45"
  decoding="async"
  style="mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 14%, #000 86%, transparent); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 14%, #000 86%, transparent)"
/>
